│                          │ optimizer learn how strongly qubits should be entangled, increasing expressivity and      │
│                          │ potentially improving fit quality, while keeping the total parameter count exactly the    │
│                          │ same (162) since no new parameter names are introduced — sharing the "rz_pre_x" params    │
│                          │ between the local RZ rotation and the entangling CRZ gate. This should improve            │
│                          │ train/validation accuracy without increasing overfitting risk from added parameters.      │
