│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The previous best-performing variant (score 0.63) used parametrized CRZ gates with        │
│                          │ deliberate parameter sharing across topologically similar edges (e.g. (0,7)/(0,8) sharing │
│                          │ "crz_2", (1,3)/(1,8) sharing "crz_3", (2,4)/(2,6) sharing "crz_4"), which both cut the    │
│                          │ parameter count and gave stronger entangling expressivity than fixed CZ gates. The        │
│                          │ current candidate regressed to fixed CZ gates on hub connections, which removed trainable │
│                          │ phase information and increased circuit depth (59 vs 41) without any accuracy benefit     │
│                          │ (score dropped to 0.58).                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit reverts the fixed CZ gates back to parametrized CRZ gates that reuse existing   │
│                          │ parameter names from adjacent entangling gates (no new distinct parameters), restoring    │
│                          │ the expressivity that helped the 0.63-scoring version while keeping the parameter count   │
│                          │ essentially unchanged. It also converts the isolated CRX(3,5) gate to a CRZ with its own  │
│                          │ dedicated parameter "crz_5", matching the proven design pattern from the best-scoring     │
│                          │ ancestor.                                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0764                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
