│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The experiment history shows that adding a 4-gate RY "mid-layer" (ry_mid_0..3) between    │
│                          │ the CRZ entangling block and the final RZ readout layer increased parameter count         │
│                          │ (162→186) and depth (41→44) but *decreased* combined score (0.63→0.62) and widened the    │
│                          │ generalization gap (0.09→0.10). This confirms the mid-layer refresh idea does not pay off │
│                          │ here — it adds expressivity that the optimizer cannot use efficiently, likely             │
│                          │ overfitting.                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit removes the RY mid-layer entirely, reverting to the leaner 162-parameter        │
│                          │ backbone that empirically generalizes better. To still get some benefit from an extra     │
│                          │ "refresh" without ballooning parameter count, it reintroduces a very light entangling     │
│                          │ touch using heavy parameter-sharing: a single shared-parameter CRY on two                 │
│                          │ previously-unused-for-CRY pairs (4,8) and (5,7) reusing already-touched qubits, added     │
│                          │ right after the existing CRZ block but before the final RZ layer, using only one extra    │
│                          │ parameter (crz_share). This nudges correlations between the two mid/late clusters at      │
│                          │ negligible parameter cost (1 param vs 4), preserving efficiency while giving a small      │
│                          │ expressivity boost.                                                                       │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0270                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 0.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 0; deleted: 2; modified: 2;                                                        │
