│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Based on the two prior results, fewer parameters in the entangling (CRZ) layer correlated │
│                          │ with a better combined score and smaller train/val gap (162-param CRZ-only version scored │
│                          │ 0.63 vs. 186-param version with an extra RY mid-layer scoring 0.62, and the 156-param     │
│                          │ CRY-mixed variant scored only 0.59). This suggests: (1) revert to a pure CRZ entangling   │
│                          │ layer (drop the CRY gates that hurt performance), and (2) push parameter sharing further  │
│                          │ in the CRZ layer to cut unique parameters from 9 to 6, reducing total trainable           │
│                          │ parameters and depth pressure while retaining full connectivity across the allowed qubit  │
│                          │ pairs. To recover some of the expressivity lost from a shallower parameter space, we      │
│                          │ reinsert a lightweight RY "refresh" layer on qubits [1,3,5,7] right after the CRZ block,  │
│                          │ but reuse the existing ry_1/ry_3/ry_5/ry_7 parameter names instead of introducing new     │
│                          │ ones — this adds interference/expressivity from composing rotations around the same       │
│                          │ generator without any extra parameter cost or significant depth increase (only 4 extra    │
│                          │ gates, 0 new params).                                                                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0602                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 0.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 4; deleted: 0; modified: 15;                                                       │
