│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The sublayer-parallelized CRZ decomposition (currently in the file) reduced depth from    │
│                          │ 41→39 but also reduced validation/test accuracy (0.63→0.61), suggesting that the original │
│                          │ strictly-sequential CRZ ordering builds up more useful correlations during training       │
│                          │ (perhaps due to its particular entangling schedule interacting well with the classical    │
│                          │ optimizer). We therefore revert the entangling block to the original, better-performing   │
│                          │ sequential CRZ ordering from the seed (score 0.63) and additionally introduce a           │
│                          │ lightweight expressivity boost: right after the RY encoding layer, we add an RX rotation  │
│                          │ on every qubit that reuses the *same* parameter name as the corresponding RY gate (e.g.   │
│                          │ RX(wire=0, param="ry_0")). This adds no new trainable parameters (parameter-sharing keeps │
│                          │ n_params fixed at 162) while giving each qubit's state a combined RY+RX rotation,         │
│                          │ exploring a richer subspace of single-qubit states before entanglement. This should       │
│                          │ improve the representational power of the encoding without increasing parameter count or  │
│                          │ hurting generalization, and it restores the higher-performing entangling schedule.        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0565                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 0.5                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 11; deleted: 0; modified: 18;                                                      │
